--- run nginx and publish container port 80 as host port 8088
80/tcp -> 0.0.0.0:8088
80/tcp -> [::]:8088
--- request the page from the host
HTTP status: 200
<title>Welcome to nginx!</title>
--- the access log shows that request
client 172.17.0.1  "GET / HTTP/1.1"  status 200
client 172.17.0.1  "GET / HTTP/1.1"  status 200
--- without -p nothing is published
dm-web2 publishes no ports, so the host cannot reach it
